# Docker build context for deploy/railway/n8n/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include only what the image copies.
*

!n8n/workflows/*.json
!n8n/scripts/bootstrap.mjs
!deploy/railway/n8n/entrypoint.sh
!deploy/railway/n8n/Dockerfile

# Explicit safety net (already covered by the allowlist): never send these to a builder.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.convex
**/.env*
**/.tmp
**/.git
**/secrets
docs/screenshots
